        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;The claim.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; Everything above the gate &lt;i&gt;proposes&lt;/i&gt;. Nothing below it runs without passing through. The two curved returns are what make this a governed loop rather than a pipeline: a refusal comes back as traced reason codes, and work discovered mid-run re-enters admission." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#55555a;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
