        <mxCell id="snote" value="&lt;b&gt;This view is drawn from the import graph, not from intent.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; It used to show &lt;font style=&quot;font-family:monospace;&quot;&gt;planner/&lt;/font&gt; in its own box with arrows leaving and none arriving — the largest gap this project had, rendered rather than described. &lt;font style=&quot;font-family:monospace;&quot;&gt;grapharc plan&lt;/font&gt; closed it, so the arrow &lt;i&gt;into&lt;/i&gt; that box is the point. &lt;font style=&quot;font-family:monospace;&quot;&gt;server/&lt;/font&gt; carries the one remaining gap marker: it still runs its own in-process session layer instead of the durable one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Re-derive before trusting the picture:&amp;nbsp; &lt;font style=&quot;font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;grep -rn &quot;grapharc.planner&quot; grapharc/ --include=*.py | grep -v &quot;^grapharc/planner/&quot;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#55555a;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
